        "Cross-reference between phase hierarchy and component hierarchy (format: ex:CrossReferenceFormat - bidirectional links with phaseTaskId, componentModuleId, linkType stored in PlanningGenerationModeState.crossReferences)",
        "Include explicit dependency links between phases and tasks (format: ex:DependencyGraphFormat - stored in PlanningGenerationModeState.dependencies)",
